title: 同仁堂徵信錄：初錄 v0.1.0（含部分 AI 獨立校讀）
type: dataset
version: 0.1.0
authors:
- name: poplolioi11
abstract: 'AI-assisted initial transcription of the 1837 edition, Bodleian Sinica
  690. All 140 IIIF canvases have initial transcription; independent AI collation
  is integrated for 41 canvases (c001–c034, c071, c115–c119, c138); 99 remain without
  integrated independent review. Human/expert review not-run. Not a complete scholarly
  edition. Fixed snapshot 2026-10-21T01:43:00Z; later collation is excluded. This
  version DOI identifies the initial transcription with partial collation. Planned
  source repository: https://github.com/poplolioi11/sinica-690-tongrentang-1837. Historical
  compiler 同仁堂司事 is distinct from the modern editor. Images excluded.'
keywords:
- 同仁堂徵信錄
- Sinica 690
- '1837'
- initial transcription
